## Scenarios

### every trait conformance obligation is checked on every engine

#### rejects an impl that omits a required trait method, on the interpreter

- Fixture provides greet but not the required farewell
- The compiler must name the unimplemented method
- The ill-formed program must not run


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 10 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Fixture provides greet but not the required farewell")
val out = compile_fixture(MISSING_METHOD, "interpreter")

step("The compiler must name the unimplemented method")
expect(out).to_contain("farewell")

step("The ill-formed program must not run")
expect(out).to_not_contain("FIXTURE_RAN_MISSING_METHOD")
expect(out).to_not_contain("EXIT=0")
```

</details>

#### rejects an impl that omits a required trait method, on the JIT

- Same fixture, engine pinned to jit


